      "description": "A man with long hair and a mustache, wearing a military uniform and a wide-brimmed hat, standing with arms crossed. He appears stern and serious, looking to the side. Based on his appearance and uniform, he is identifiable as General George Armstrong Custer, a Union Army officer during the American Civil War, and later known for his role in the Battle of Little Bighorn. His historical association with Native American conflict is central to the meme's context.",
