      "description": "The man in the image has a stern, serious facial expression with a set jaw and intense gaze, conveying a strong sense of anger and contempt. This is reinforced by his arms-crossed posture, which is a common gesture of defiance and frustration. The text 'fuck banks' and 'fuck indians too' explicitly expresses extreme anger and hatred toward both financial institutions and Native American peoples.",
