      "instance_name": "mapping_fuck_banks_to_custer",
      "label": "The text 'fuck banks' is mapped onto the visual entity of General Custer",
      "description": "The text 'fuck banks' is positioned directly over the image of General Custer, creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity (Custer) is interpreted as embodying the sentiment expressed in the text. This mapping leverages Custer's historical association with military aggression and failure to symbolize the hatred toward banks. The visual material (Custer) is mapped onto the textual material ('fuck banks') to imply that Custer represents the aggressive, destructive force being directed at banks.",
